{"id":"zukommen","lemma":"zukommen","pos":"verb","rank":4218,"glosses":["to come towards, come up to; to approach","to become, befit"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/7b/De-zukommen.ogg/De-zukommen.ogg.mp3","conjugation":{"indicative":{"present":{"1s":"komme zu","1p":"kommen zu","2s":"kommst zu","2p":"kommt zu","3s":"kommt zu","3p":"kommen zu"},"preterite":{"1s":"kam zu","1p":"kamen zu","2s":"kamst zu","2p":"kamt zu","3s":"kam zu","3p":"kamen zu"},"perfect":{"1s":"bin zugekommen","1p":"sind zugekommen","2s":"bist zugekommen","2p":"seid zugekommen","3s":"ist zugekommen","3p":"sind zugekommen"},"future":{"1s":"werde zukommen","1p":"werden zukommen","2s":"wirst zukommen","2p":"werdet zukommen","3s":"wird zukommen","3p":"werden zukommen"}},"subjunctive":{"imperfect":{"1s":"käme zu","1p":"kämen zu","2s":"kämest zu","2p":"kämet zu","3s":"käme zu","3p":"kämen zu"},"conditional":{"1s":"würde zukommen","1p":"würden zukommen","2s":"würdest zukommen","2p":"würdet zukommen","3s":"würde zukommen","3p":"würden zukommen"}},"imperative":{"affirmative":{"2s":"komm zu","2p":"kommt zu"}}},"nonFinite":{"participle":"zugekommen"},"examples":[{"text":"Wir haben ihnen Gelegenheit zukommen lassen, sich zu ergeben.","en":"We've given them the opportunity to surrender.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"have"},{"g":"(to) them","l":"sie"},{"g":"opportunity"},null,{"g":"to allow"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"to yield, produce"}]},{"text":"Das will ich Tom als Geschenk zukommen lassen.","en":"I plan to give this to Tom as a gift.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"to want","l":"wollen"},{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"at the same moment"},{"g":"present, gift"},null,{"g":"to allow"}]},{"text":"Du solltest ihr lieber eine Geschenkkarte zukommen lassen.","en":"You should buy her a gift card instead.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"should","l":"sollen"},{"g":"you (pl.) / her"},{"g":"lovable","l":"lieb"},{"g":"a"},null,null,{"g":"to allow"}]},{"text":"Tom sah Maria auf ihn zukommen.","en":"Tom saw Mary coming towards him.","words":[null,{"g":"to see","l":"sehen"},null,{"g":"on"},{"g":"him"},null]},{"text":"Tom ließ mir alle Hilfe zukommen, die ich benötigte.","en":"Tom gave me all the help I needed.","words":[null,{"g":"to allow","l":"lassen"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},{"g":"all, everyone"},{"g":"the act of helping"},null,{"g":"the"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"to need, to require","l":"benötigen"}]}]}